lists/definitions.json contains definitions adapted from Open English WordNet
(2025 edition), https://github.com/globalwordnet/english-wordnet

Open English WordNet is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

It is derived from Princeton WordNet 3.0, Copyright 2006 by Princeton
University.

Changes: only the first definition for each part of speech is kept, at most
two per word; inflected words are matched to their base word; senses whose
definition labels the word as a slur or offensive term are removed; and some
definitions are replaced or added by hand (rules/definitions.txt).
